  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: '<size=22>- All Dollar Bill symbols are Scatters.

      - Wins can occur in any position and are not limited to direction or reel placement.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: "<size=18>- Special Spot exists on the Extra Reel. \n- Any and all Mystery
      Symbols on the\nmain reel will change to the symbol\nthat appears in the Special
      Spot.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: '<size=18>- 5 or more Bonus symbols triggers

      the Choose Your Free Games bonus.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=18>- Scatter wins are awarded for 5 or more of the same Dollar Bill
      symbols appearing in any position on the reels.\r\n- 13 or more Scatters pays
      the same coin amounts despite the hierarchy of the symbol. \n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_NUMBER_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: '<b><size=24>

