  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>

      <style=coinColor>{10:CommaNumber}</style>

      <style=coinColor>{9:CommaNumber}</style>

      <style=coinColor>{8:CommaNumber}</style></b>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{7:CommaNumber}</color>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{6:CommaNumber}</color>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{5:CommaNumber}</color>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{4:CommaNumber}</color>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{3:CommaNumber}</color>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{2:CommaNumber}</color>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{1:CommaNumber}</color>

      <color=#FFFFFF>{0:CommaNumber}</color>

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '<size=18>- Tap to change the location of the Special Spot to any of the
      3 positions

      on the Extra Reel.

      - The Special Spot may be changed anytime when reel spin is at a stop.

      - Any and all Mystery Symbols on the main reel will change to the symbol that
      appears

      in the Special Spot.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: '<size=18>- 5 or more Bonus symbols triggers the Choose Your Free Games
      bonus.

      - Choose Your Free Games gives 5 bonus options with different Dollar Bill symbols
      and number of free spins.

      - More initial Bonus symbols enables more free spins in the 5 options.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: "<size=18>- During Free Games, 5 or more of the user's selected symbol
      triggers Hold & Re-Spin.\n- During Hold & Re-Spin, all selected Scatter symbol
      will remain locked in place while remaining spots spin.\n- Hold & Re-Spin lasts
      for 3 spins initially. When any additional selected Scatter appears, award +1
      spin.\n- If the selected Scatter fills the entire screen, award Scatter pay
      times 2!"
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Happy Dollars
